flowchart LR
    Repo["仓库内证据<br/>38章 / 10项目 / 252测试"] --> Internal["三类维护者角色复审"]
    Internal --> External{外部门禁}
    External --> Review[独立技术与中文外审]
    External --> Trial[真实试学与企业试讲]
    External --> Device[实体设备、印刷与权利核查]
    Review --> Feedback[关闭 P0/P1 反馈]
    Trial --> Feedback
    Device --> Feedback
    Feedback --> Score{五类目标均达标}
    Score -->|是| Release[合并 main 并发布最终 Release]
    Score -->|否| Improve[修订并重新验收]
    Improve --> External
